@startuml
' EXPECT (preproc): the clock itself is the only thing that changes from one run to the next, so the
' test only checks its shape: a float of seconds, and the functions without argument use it
' title float True 9 True
title !{type(time.time()).__name__} !{time.time() > 1700000000} !{len(time.gmtime())} !{time.gmtime()[0] == time.localtime()[0]}
@enduml
